cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "doppler1090"
abstract: >-
  A passive aircraft Doppler tracker for RTL-SDR. It measures the Doppler shift
  of ADS-B aircraft on 1090 MHz and compares the measured track against the
  shift predicted from each aircraft's own reported position and velocity.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aaron
    family-names: Hanson
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8432-3816"
repository-code: "https://github.com/coffee-converter/doppler1090"
license: GPL-3.0
keywords:
